1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,341
What changes the rate?

2
00:00:01,341 --> 00:00:03,997
First, the nature of the reactants.

3
00:00:03,997 --> 00:00:09,127
Ionic reactions are instant because no covalent bond must break.

4
00:00:09,127 --> 00:00:10,546
And surface area.

5
00:00:10,546 --> 00:00:14,856
A marble chip in dilute hydrochloric acid fizzes slowly.

6
00:00:14,856 --> 00:00:20,820
The same mass, powdered, fizzes furiously, because far more surface is exposed.

7
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:25,273
That is why limestone is crushed before it goes into a lime kiln.

